e336f40e41e06"} {"question" "q-119948" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "First, let's recall the double-angle formula for sine: \n\n$$\n2\\operatorname{sin}⁡x\\operatorname{cos}⁡x=\\operatorname{sin}⁡2x\n$$\n\nSubstituting $x=\\frac{\\pi }{10}$ into the above, we get:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}2\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{10})\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{10}) & =\\operatorname{sin}⁡(2\\cdot \\frac{\\pi }{10}) \\\\ 2\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{10})\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{10}) & =\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{5})\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we can rewrite the given expression using the above, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{2\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{10})\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{10})}{\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{5})} & =\\frac{\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{5})}{\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{5})}=\\operatorname{tan}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{5})\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14037917/state.json" "file_sha256" "1f7f6ff176d917a4ba88e288364baec356633e9fa45243a875ce336f40e41e06"} {"question" "q-119948" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/moderate "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14037917/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "d96287fa82e8ee1c94c433c206151cc0784b66e30617233fb7a2b93e261a66c3"} {"question" "q-119948" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14037917/state.json" "file_sha256" "1f7f6ff176d917a4ba88e288364baec356633e9fa45243a875ce336f40e41e06"} {"question" "q-119948" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "2\\operatorname{tan}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{1