la for sine: \n\n$$\n2\\operatorname{sin}⁡x\\operatorname{cos}⁡x=\\operatorname{sin}⁡2x\n$$\n\nSubstituting $x=\\frac{\\pi }{6}$ into the above, we get\n\n$$\n2\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{6})\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{6})=\\operatorname{sin}⁡(2\\cdot \\frac{\\pi }{6})=\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{3}).\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n4\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{6})\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{6})=2\\cdot 2\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{6})\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{6})=2\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{3}).\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14037917/state.json" "file_sha256" "1f7f6ff176d917a4ba88e288364baec356633e9fa45243a875ce336f40e41e06"} {"question" "q-24647" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/easy "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14037917/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "d96287fa82e8ee1c94c433c206151cc0784b66e30617233fb7a2b93e261a66c3"} {"question" "q-24647" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14037917/state.json" "file_sha256" "1f7f6ff176d917a4ba88e288364baec356633e9fa45243a875ce336f40e41e06"} {"question" "q-24647" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "2\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{3})"] ["math" "4\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{3})"] ["math" "4\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{6})"] ["math" "\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{6})"] ["math" "\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{3})"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14037917/state.json" "file_sha256" "1f7f6ff176d917a4ba88e288364